            "sid": "DEU 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Imwe muli bantu ba Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Kale ni muteesalasalanga ku mibiri gyaimwe, oba okumwa enviiri gha mberi ku mitwe gyaimwe ni giba ng'oti gya mpaata, ng'abantu abandi bwe bakola nga bali kulira abafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 19:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe muli ighanga itukuvu erya Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Yabalondamu okuba eighanga erirye ku bubwe mu maghanga agandi goonagoona agali ku nsi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
